* Transmission Gate Ron vs Pass Voltage
* {label}
* NMOS + PMOS complementary switch, W/L = {WL_ratio}

.include {model_path}

* Supply
Vdd vdd 0 DC {vdd}

* Control signals: NMOS gate = VDD (ON), PMOS gate = 0 (ON)
Vclk clk 0 DC {vdd}
Vclkb clkb 0 DC 0

* Pass voltage (swept)
Vin in 0 DC 0

* Small perturbation voltage for Ron measurement (10 mV)
Vdelta out in DC 0.01

* NMOS: drain=out, gate=clk, source=in, bulk=0
M1 out clk in 0 {nmos_model} W={W}u L={L}u

* PMOS: drain=out, gate=clkb, source=in, bulk=vdd
M2 out clkb in vdd {pmos_model} W={W}u L={L}u

.dc Vin {vpass_start} {vpass_stop} {vpass_step}

.print dc i(Vdelta)

.end
